To get started and install tanja-dev, follow these steps below:

1) Give execution permissions to install.sh
   -> chmod +x install.sh

2) Run installation script
   -> ./install.sh

To uninstall tanja-dev, follow these steps below:

1) Give execution permissions to uninstall.sh
   -> chmod +x uninstall.sh

2) Run uninstallation script
   -> ./uninstall.sh

That's it! For more information or would like to contact support, please contact saffron.msk@gmail.com
